{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_thought_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\n"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "To determine whether **221** is a prime number, we"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": " test for divisibility by prime numbers up to $\\sqrt{221}$:\n\n1. **Find the limit:** \n   - $"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "14^2 = 196$ and $15^2 = 225$, so $\\sqrt{22"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "1} \\approx 14.87$.\n   - We only need to check primes less than or equal to "}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "14: **2, 3, 5, 7, 11, and 13**.\n\n2. **"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "Test prime factors:**\n   - **2:** 221 is odd (ends in 1) $\\rightarrow$ Not"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": " divisible by 2.\n   - **3:** Sum of digits is $2 + 2 + 1 = 5$,"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": " which is not divisible by 3 $\\rightarrow$ Not divisible by 3.\n   - **5:** The last digit is neither"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": " 0 nor 5 $\\rightarrow$ Not divisible by 5.\n   - **7:** $221"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": " = 7 \\times 31 + 4$ (remainder 4) $\\rightarrow$ Not divisible by 7.\n"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "   - **11:** $221 = 11 \\times 20 + 1$ ("}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "remainder 1) $\\rightarrow$ Not divisible by 11.\n   - **13:** $221 \\"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "div 13 = 17$ exactly ($13 \\times 17 = 221$).\n\nBecause $22"}}}}}
{"dir": "out", "frame": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "session/update", "params": {"sessionId": "dd13eb1b-5dcf-487d-abca-6989dae408e2", "update": {"sessionUpdate": "agent_message_chunk", "content": {"type": "text", "text": "1 = 13 \\times 17$, it is composite.\n\n**No**"}}}}}
